[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Bloomburrow (plane)","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29#:~:text=This%20specialization%20led%20to,actual%20civilization%20of%20Valley.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Bloomburrow (plane)\", section \"Foundation of Valley\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"Lily Emberseed repelled the beasts, ending the War of Cinders.","cites":["mouse-e1","mouse-e0"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Mouse#:~:text=assembled%20a%20rag%2Dtag%20group,against%20the%20Calamity%20Beasts","https://mtg.wiki/page/Mouse#:~:text=the%20mousefolk%20Lily%20Emberseed,the%20War%20of%20Cinders"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Mouse","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Mouse","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Mouse#:~:text=assembled%20a%20rag%2Dtag%20group,against%20the%20Calamity%20Beasts","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Mouse\", section \"Bloomburrow\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Mouse","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Mouse","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Mouse#:~:text=the%20mousefolk%20Lily%20Emberseed,the%20War%20of%20Cinders","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Mouse\", section \"Bloomburrow\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"A mischievous interloper nearly caused an apocalypse by trying to control them, after which the ratfolk became secretive.","cites":["rat-e0"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Rat#:~:text=a%20mischievous%20interloper%20nearly,control%20the%20Calamity%20Beasts"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Rat","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Rat","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Rat#:~:text=a%20mischievous%20interloper%20nearly,control%20the%20Calamity%20Beasts","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Rat\", section \"Bloomburrow\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"Visions of Valley's destruction by the beasts haunted King Glarb for many seasons, and he hired Cruelclaw to steal a Calamity Beast's egg, reawakening their fury.","cites":["glarb-e0","bloomburrow-plane-e6"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Glarb#:~:text=Visions%20of%20Valley%27s%20destruction,dreams%20for%20many%20seasons","https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29#:~:text=King%20Glarb%20hired%20the,egg%2C%20reawakening%20their%20fury"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Glarb","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Glarb","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Glarb#:~:text=Visions%20of%20Valley%27s%20destruction,dreams%20for%20many%20seasons","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Glarb\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Bloomburrow (plane)","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29#:~:text=King%20Glarb%20hired%20the,egg%2C%20reawakening%20their%20fury","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Bloomburrow (plane)\", section \"Calamity returns to Valley\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"The theft caused an unprecedented rampage by Maha and the other beasts, and Mabel called on all to help against them.","cites":["glarb-e2","blb-e2"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Glarb#:~:text=the%20theft%20of%20the,the%20other%20Calamity%20Beasts","https://scryfall.com/card/blb/173/galewind-moose#:~:text=Something%20has%20stirred%20the,they%20are%20wreaking%20havoc."],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Glarb","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Glarb","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Glarb#:~:text=the%20theft%20of%20the,the%20other%20Calamity%20Beasts","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Glarb\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"card-text","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Galewind Moose","series":"Bloomburrow","authors":[],"date":"2024-08-02","url":"https://scryfall.com/card/blb/173/galewind-moose","link":"https://scryfall.com/card/blb/173/galewind-moose#:~:text=Something%20has%20stirred%20the,they%20are%20wreaking%20havoc.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"Galewind Moose (Bloomburrow, 2024), flavor text. Wizards of the Coast."}]},{"text":"Mabel's group of small warriors and misfits returned the egg, stopping the beasts.","cites":["bloomburrow-plane-e8"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29#:~:text=A%20group%20of%20small,egg%2C%20stopping%20the%20Beasts."],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Bloomburrow (plane)","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29#:~:text=A%20group%20of%20small,egg%2C%20stopping%20the%20Beasts.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Bloomburrow (plane)\", section \"Calamity returns to Valley\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]}],"status":{"text":"The beasts were stopped when Mabel's group returned the stolen egg, though they remain a recurring threat to Valley.","cites":["bloomburrow-plane-e8","bloomburrow-plane-e5"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Bloomburrow_%28plane%29#:~:text=A%20group%20of%20small,egg%2C%20stopping%20the%20Beasts.","https:/